# AFL model pickles stay in normal Git when we only keep the latest artifact(s).
# Do NOT track them with Git LFS: daily/nightly CI + Vercel clones were burning
# the free 10GB/month LFS bandwidth in a few days.
#
# If a future pickle exceeds GitHub's 100MB blob limit, store it outside git
# (or use a single LFS object with aggressive pruning) -- never accumulate history.

# Keep workflow and source files UTF-8 + LF (avoid Windows UTF-16 breaking Turbopack/GitHub Actions).
.github/workflows/* text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
